                "word": "zielenheil",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "909c456f-0b76-341c-8929-b973c72212f3",
                        "entry_id": "53298023-79d4-3626-a5cf-5c7dd73c4e1f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het geluk en de rust die je hebt als je leeft als een goed mens"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c306b6b1-66ef-4c0b-a4c2-253f10b8d3e3",
                                "sense_id": "909c456f-0b76-341c-8929-b973c72212f3",
                                "text": "Een leider binnen de Russisch-Orthodoxe Kerk heeft de gelovigen vrijdag opgeroepen te bidden voor „het zielenheil” van Vladimir en Ljoedmila Poetin. „Het bericht van hun scheiding is triest nieuws”, zei Kirill Frolov van de Orthodoxe Burgerunie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "203e930e-f4b5-387a-a71b-2a313ea3c144",
                        "entry_id": "53298023-79d4-3626-a5cf-5c7dd73c4e1f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "de rust en het geluk van een overleden persoon in het hiernamaals"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0c9c631-e4e2-4d58-a90b-11b8bf23ddac",
                                "sense_id": "203e930e-f4b5-387a-a71b-2a313ea3c144",
                                "text": "Ook zaterdag werd de populaire Bhumibol overal herdacht. Talloze onderdanen, veelal in het zwart gekleed, alsmede vele boeddhistische monniken baden op straat voor het zielenheil van de overleden koning. De kroonprins is veel minder populair. Prins Maha is drie keer getrouwd en gescheiden, en liet zich weinig in Thailand zien. Hij verbleef onder meer vaak en lang in Duitsland."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a9239d4-b772-4ec4-8c31-b3fd71c5962a",
                        "source_entry_id": "53298023-79d4-3626-a5cf-5c7dd73c4e1f",
                        "source_sense_id": "909c456f-0b76-341c-8929-b973c72212f3",
                        "source_sense_description": "het geluk en de rust die je hebt als je leeft als een goed mens",
                        "target_lang_word": "salvation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "salvation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c36e0831-a3de-3ee5-8b79-d3bc68b8c866",
                                        "entry_id": "45e80cce-67db-3331-90aa-97f5019246e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of being saved, the state of having been saved (from hell)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8a6724f-bd68-44e8-9e52-4e8bc5e64fde",
                                                "sense_id": "c36e0831-a3de-3ee5-8b79-d3bc68b8c866",
                                                "text": "Collective salvation is not possible without personal salvation, but the latter is achievable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccac37b7-eef1-350a-97ef-88fdec1f1100",
                                        "entry_id": "45e80cce-67db-3331-90aa-97f5019246e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of saving, rescuing (in any context), providing needed safety or liberation; something that does this."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "often",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac3b828f-7bf2-4684-a7f7-214cce7e6d02",
                                                "sense_id": "ccac37b7-eef1-350a-97ef-88fdec1f1100",
                                                "text": "Though this is not meant as a medical advice, smoking grass was an occasional salvation; it reduced the nausea, raised my spirits and even gave me a small appetite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fb5fce8-257c-36bb-a411-a5330e4027f4",
                                        "entry_id": "45e80cce-67db-3331-90aa-97f5019246e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of being restored or made new for the purpose of becoming saved; the process of being rid of the old poor quality conditions and becoming improved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ccac6a5-f809-48db-995a-6c11ad216317",
                                                "sense_id": "3fb5fce8-257c-36bb-a411-a5330e4027f4",
                                                "text": "If the Government believes that part of the railways' salvation is to be found in ridding them of extraneous concerns, it should have had the courage either to close the railway works down as quickly as possible, or to hive them off as an entirely separate concern, [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
